# Exceptions to docs/STYLE.md. Format: <path glob>|<rule id or *>|<reason>
LICENSE|*|Standard MIT license text is quoted verbatim.
tests/style/bad.md|*|Fixture that must fail the style rules.
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md|*|Adopted text, quoted verbatim.
docs/evidence.md|double-dash|Generated report that quotes raw tool output.
